From 5580866d4e6127e0190d2e5b118248a08d51af83 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 02:00:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add LICENSE.mecab-ko for the vendored native library

CIBW_BEFORE_ALL_LINUX builds libmecab from NoUnique/mecab-ko's own
mecab-ko fork (./configure && make install, mirroring mecab-python3's
build of taku910/mecab in this same repo), and auditwheel then vendors
the resulting shared object into mecab_ko.libs/ inside the wheel.

mecab-ko's own COPYING offers a choice of GPL (see its GPL file), LGPL
(see LGPL) or BSD (see BSD) and carries no license text of its own
beyond that -- it is a Korean-dictionary fork of Taku Kudo/NTT's
original MeCab, whose BSD text this patch reproduces verbatim from
mecab-ko's own BSD file (identical wording to the same tri-license
already resolved for the mecab, mecab-python3 and python-mecab-ko
ports in this repo). setuptools' license_files defaults pick this file
up automatically alongside LICENSE, with no setup.py change.

Upstream-Status: To upstream [blocked: this port may only touch riseproject-dev/python-wheels]
---
 LICENSE.mecab-ko | 29 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 29 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 LICENSE.mecab-ko

diff --git a/LICENSE.mecab-ko b/LICENSE.mecab-ko
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..9ae6ded
--- /dev/null
+++ b/LICENSE.mecab-ko
@@ -0,0 +1,29 @@
